# Metal presentation stability route. This mirrors the packaged raw-ROM GP
# route, then holds a live race long enough for windowed, resize, and fullscreen
# capture so intermittent black presents cannot hide in a short smoke test.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 1 5400
LOG metal_stability_race_hold
WAIT 18000
QUIT
